    "detailed_description": "Days move fast in your little solar system, and so do the pests! Can you collect enough crops before the invading pests take over your garden?<br><br>This fast paced garden defense game features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>24 levels across 4 planets<br></li><li>custom levels to set your own challenge<br></li><li>control rebinding<br></li><li>my blood sweat and tears<br></li><li>cute Kenney assets<br></li><li>a little guy that goes around<br></li><li>a day-night cycle like you wouldn't believe<br></li><li>absolutely no plot</li></ul><br>It's a little game you go around hitting little guys. You get it. Have fun.",
